# Regenerable products of a local run: the generated AIR, the linked metallib,
# the compiled dispatch host, the per-case operand and result binaries, and the
# manifest the driver hands the host. `contraction_probe.py --work-dir` writes
# all of it and reconstructs all of it; the evidence is the TSVs under
# `results/`, which stay tracked.
#
# The rule covers this one directory and nothing broader. Passing no
# `--work-dir` puts the same products in a temporary OS directory the driver
# removes, which nothing here needs to ignore.
/local-work/
__pycache__/
